  "bodyHash": "5eca88dc6edfc638",
  "content": "\n\n<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/695/948/sbt_banner.png\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"722\" height=\"183\"></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此模組讓您在物品欄中將游標懸停在潛影盒上時，按下 <code>Shift</code> 鍵即可查看其內容的預覽視窗。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>同時支援 Fabric 與 MinecraftForge</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><strong>下載</strong></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> <strong><strong>Fabric：</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/6678389\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/5639021\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.6</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827832\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.4</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827838\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.2</a> （舊版：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/3999638\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.17.1</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/3999663\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.16.5</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/2975404\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.15.2</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/2788715\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.14.4</a>）</strong> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><strong>MinecraftForge：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/6678391\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/5639022\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.6</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827833\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.4</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827839\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.2</a> </strong> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>NeoForge：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/6678392\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/5639023\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20.6</span></a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>於 Fabric 平台：</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://fabricmc.net/use/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"> API</a>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">建議安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>（非強制）以方便遊戲內設定</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">精簡預覽</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">將游標懸停在物品上時，按下 <code>Shift</code> 鍵（預設）。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/159/compact_preview_2.png\" alt=\"Compact Preview Image\" width=\"465\" height=\"262\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">完整預覽</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">將游標懸停在物品上時，按下 <code>Alt + Shift</code> 鍵（預設），即可顯示其完整內容，所有堆疊物品皆會正確對應至各自格位。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/163/full_preview_1.png\" alt=\"Full Preview Image\" width=\"464\" height=\"254\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">其他容器</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">此預覽功能同樣適用於在創造模式下使用 <code>Ctrl + 快捷複製</code> 取得的物品（例如箱子、熔爐、木桶等）...</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">也支援大多數模組新增的容器。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/160/other_containers_preview.png\" alt=\"Other Containers Preview Image\" width=\"464\" height=\"261\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">戰利品表</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">若懸停的物品具有戰利品表，則會於工具提示中顯示該表的名稱。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">此選項預設為關閉。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/169/loot_table_tooltip_info.png\" alt=\"Loot Table Info Image\" width=\"467\" height=\"262\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">自訂設定</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模組的大多數設定均可透過設定選單進行調整。請進入 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組選單</a>，選擇 <code>ShulkerBoxTooltip</code> 後點擊齒輪圖示。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">各選項的詳細資訊請參閱遊戲內說明文件或 <a href=\"https://github.com/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/wiki/Configuration-Options\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基頁面</a>。設定檔位於 <code>&lt;我的世界資料夾&gt;/config/shulkerboxtooltip.json5</code></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/900/95/config-mk2.png\" alt=\"Config Sceen Image\" width=\"474\" height=\"248\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">色彩變化！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">預覽視窗的色彩會隨潛影盒的顏色而改變，您可在設定中關閉此功能。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">伺服器支援</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">本模組亦可選擇性地安裝於伺服器端，以提供額外功能（例如終界箱預覽）。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
